---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Portfolio" description="Anonymized ALVOCOR LLC case study examples covering workflow platforms, API integration, legacy modernization, and AI-assisted automation." canonicalPath="/Portfolio">
<section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="eyebrow mb-3">Portfolio</div>
        <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold mb-3">Representative project examples.</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-0">These anonymized examples illustrate the kinds of software, integration, modernization, and automation work ALVOCOR can support.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section-pad bg-white">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row g-4">
            <div class="col-md-6">
                <article class="case-card h-100">
                    <div class="case-number">01</div>
                    <div class="section-kicker">Workflow Systems</div>
                    <h2>Enterprise Workflow Platform</h2>
                    <div class="architecture-strip" aria-label="Conceptual architecture: users to application to database and reporting">
                        <span>Users</span><span>App</span><span>Data</span><span>Reports</span>
                    </div>
                    <p>Designed a role-based platform concept for tracking operational requests, approvals, status changes, reporting, and administrative workflows.</p>
                    <p><strong>Focus:</strong> User experience, business rules, data modeling, reporting, auditability, and maintainable application architecture.</p>
                    <div class="outcome-list" aria-label="Targeted outcomes">
                        <span>Clearer request status</span>
                        <span>Role-based workflow</span>
                        <span>Audit-ready records</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="tech-badges" aria-label="Related technologies">
                        <span>ASP.NET Core</span><span>SQL Server</span><span>EF Core</span><span>Bootstrap</span><span>Role-based access</span>
                    </div>
                </article>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6">
                <article class="case-card h-100">
                    <div class="case-number">02</div>
                    <div class="section-kicker">Integration</div>
                    <h2>API Integration &amp; Automation</h2>
                    <div class="architecture-strip" aria-label="Conceptual architecture: source system to API to automation and monitoring">
                        <span>System</span><span>API</span><span>Jobs</span><span>Logs</span>
                    </div>
                    <p>Planned secure API integrations to reduce repeated data entry, coordinate handoffs between systems, and standardize error handling.</p>
                    <p><strong>Focus:</strong> REST APIs, authentication, background processing, logging, retries, and operational monitoring.</p>
                    <div class="outcome-list" aria-label="Targeted outcomes">
                        <span>Less duplicate entry</span>
                        <span>More reliable handoffs</span>
                        <span>Improved error visibility</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="tech-badges" aria-label="Related technologies">
                        <span>Web API</span><span>OAuth</span><span>JSON</span><span>SQL Server</span><span>Webhooks</span>
                    </div>
                </article>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6">
                <article class="case-card h-100">
                    <div class="case-number">03</div>
                    <div class="section-kicker">Modernization</div>
                    <h2>Legacy Application Modernization</h2>
                    <div class="architecture-strip" aria-label="Conceptual architecture: legacy system to migration plan to modern application">
                        <span>Legacy</span><span>Plan</span><span>Modern</span><span>Cloud</span>
                    </div>
                    <p>Outlined an incremental modernization path for older business software, balancing feature continuity with maintainability improvements.</p>
                    <p><strong>Focus:</strong> Code assessment, database access improvements, UI refresh, deployment simplification, and staged migration planning.</p>
                    <div class="outcome-list" aria-label="Targeted outcomes">
                        <span>Lower migration risk</span>
                        <span>Cleaner deployment path</span>
                        <span>Improved maintainability</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="tech-badges" aria-label="Related technologies">
                        <span>.NET</span><span>ASP.NET Core</span><span>SQL Server</span><span>EF Core</span><span>Azure-ready</span>
                    </div>
                </article>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6">
                <article class="case-card h-100">
                    <div class="case-number">04</div>
                    <div class="section-kicker">AI Automation</div>
                    <h2>AI-Assisted Process Automation</h2>
                    <div class="architecture-strip" aria-label="Conceptual architecture: documents to AI assist to review and workflow">
                        <span>Input</span><span>AI</span><span>Review</span><span>Action</span>
                    </div>
                    <p>Created an automation approach for using AI to assist with information intake, summarization, classification, and task routing.</p>
                    <p><strong>Focus:</strong> Human review, data privacy, prompt structure, workflow fit, measurable time savings, and responsible AI use.</p>
                    <div class="outcome-list" aria-label="Targeted outcomes">
                        <span>Faster intake review</span>
                        <span>Human-in-the-loop control</span>
                        <span>More consistent routing</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="tech-badges" aria-label="Related technologies">
                        <span>OpenAI APIs</span><span>.NET</span><span>Python</span><span>Documents</span><span>Automation</span>
                    </div>
                </article>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

</Layout>
